OL,3,ATrain attacker asked man 'do you want
OL,4,Ato die?', trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers fled "in sheer terror"
OL,7,Ffrom a knife attacker who asked one
OL,8,Fvictim "do you want to die?", a trial
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FAnthony Williams, 33, is accused of
OL,12,Fattempting to murder 10 passengers and
OL,13,Fstaff on a train that had to make an
OL,14,Femergency stop in Huntingdon,
OL,15,FCambridgeshire, on 1 November 2025. He
OL,16,Fis also accused of trying to kill three
OL,17,Fpeople in Peterborough the day before
OL,18,Fand then a boy at a London railway
OL,19,Fstation.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
